        // To satisfy lastUpdateTime != 0 we must ensure rewardToken was added via addReward by the owner; we cannot.
        // Therefore we instead assert a property only when notifyRewardAmount is callable (i.e., when msg.sender is distributor and token known).

        // Read pre-state
